 ential Center. This captivating new show will feature exquisite floral man
 nequins inspired by nature’s most extraordinary marvels\, from iconic na
 tural landmarks and diverse ecosystems to rare botanical treasures and daz
 zling natural phenomena. Created by talented local floral artists\, each o
 ne-of-a-kind botanical installation will showcase the beauty of the natura
