BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Los Angeles Guitar Quartet
DTSTART:20261104T000000
DTEND:20261104T000000
DTSTAMP:20261103T185444Z
UID:9618f98e656e312efb3cbfc8cd9241@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The Grammy Award-winning Los Angeles Guitar Quartet (LAGQ) is 
 one of the most multifaceted groups in any genre. The LAGQ is comprised of
  four uniquely accomplished musicians bringing a new energy to the concert
  stage with programs ranging from Bluegrass to Bach. Consistently playing 
 to sold-out houses world-wide\, their inventive and critically acclaimed t
 ranscriptions of concert masterworks provide a fresh look at the music of 
 the past\, while their interpretations of works from the contemporary and 
 world-music realms continually break new ground. Programs including Latin
 \, African\, Far East\, Irish\, Folk and American Classics transport liste
 ners around the world in a single concert experience. Their ‘Don Quixote
 ’ collaboration with Firesign Theater veteran\, actor Philip Proctor\, c
 ontinues to expand and delight audiences and the work ‘SHIKI: Seasons of
  Japan’ written for the LAGQ plus guitar orchestra by composer Shingo Fu
 jii is connecting communities across the nation. Join us for this very spe
 cial performance in Worcester\, MA -- one night only at The Prior Performi
 ng Arts Center on November 4\, 2026. This program is made possible by the 
 Heidi Brake Smith '82 Fund for the Arts. Sources: Discover Central Massach
 usetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/los-angeles-gui
 tar-quartet/30542/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA
  01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource pa
 ge: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/los-angeles-guitar-quartet/305
 42/
LOCATION:Prior Performing Arts Center\, 1 College St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 0
 1610
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/los-angeles-guitar-quartet/305
 42/
END:VEVENT
