BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winter Classes Registration Day
DTSTART:20261104T000000
DTEND:20261104T000000
DTSTAMP:20261103T185444Z
UID:5e1cb82de79399d592c6c9d1dd73a1@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:WCC Winter Registration opens on Wednesday\, November 4\, at 1
 2 Noon Winter is coming to the Worcester Center for Crafts\, and we’re w
 arming things up with a new season of classes! This winter\, discover retu
 rning favorites and exciting new offerings in ceramics\, printmaking\, pai
 nting\, photography\, metals\, glass\, healing arts\, and more. Whether yo
 u’re a beginner ready to try something new or an experienced maker looki
 ng to deepen your practice\, there’s something for everyone. Snow way yo
 u want to miss out - sign up today & make something wonderful this winter!
  Spots fill fast! You can view the upcoming Winter offerings from the digi
 tal brochures posted on our website Click Here to View the Winter Digital 
 Brochure Register Online: https://register.worcestercraftcenter.org/wconne
 ct/ACE/search.awp What to expect on registration day: Our website experien
 ces a lot of traffic on registration day. While we are incredibly grateful
  for the growing interest in our programs\, this does lead to some technic
 al difficulties. Please expect the website to be slower than normal during
  this time. If this occurs\, please do not click buttons multiple times- t
 his may lead to duplicate enrollments or payments. If you believe this has
  happened\, please email the registration office at wccregistration@worces
 ter.edu and we will rectify the issue. If you cannot remember your passwor
 d\, please use the password reset option on the log-in page. Do not make a
  new account. We recommend checking your log in information before launch 
 day. This will allow you time to reset your password or request extra help
  if necessary. When registration opens\, you may need to refresh your page
 . Once it is 12 noon EST\, you may need to refresh your page if you are no
 t seeing the course offerings. Please be patient. Our registration launch 
 is done manually so it may take some time to show up on your end. Choose y
 our courses carefully. Some courses have prerequisites or material lists. 
 It is important to read all the information in the course description befo
 re signing up for a class. Similarly\, please refrain from "saving spaces"
  in classes or signing up for courses without checking the dates work for 
 your schedule. We understand that registration day is very fast paced so w
 e recommend reading all the course info beforehand through our digital bro
 chure (referenced above). Classes fill up quickly! - Registration launch d
 ay is very similar to ticket sales for a popular concert. If you are unabl
 e to register for the course of your choice\, please be sure to add your n
 ame to the waitlist. We tend to get cancellations as course start dates ge
 t closer and many students off of the waitlist are able to enroll in the c
 ourses of their choice. If you are unable to add yourself to the waitlist 
 online you can email wccregistration@worcester.edu and we can help you! Cu
 stomer Support may be delayed. Our goal is to help all of our students on 
 registration launch day\, however\, we tend to get many inquiries at this 
 time. We thank you in advanced for your understanding and appreciate your 
 patience. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.
 discovercentralma.org/event/winter-classes-registration-day/31036/\n\nEven
 ts Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local f
 allback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discoverce
 ntralma.org/event/winter-classes-registration-day/31036/
LOCATION:Worcester Center for Crafts\, 25 Sagamore Rd.\, Worcester\, MA\, 
 01605
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/winter-classes-registration-da
 y/31036/
END:VEVENT
